**New** (conditional rendering):
```pug
// SM/SI: Show "Bed Spaces" input
div.sm-si-only(style="display: none;")
  label Bed Spaces:
  input(type="number", name="firecells[0][occupantLoad]", min="0", step="1", title="Number of beds (accounts for staff and visitors per CAS2 1.4.5)", placeholder="e.g., 10 beds")

